<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33503" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔλδομαι</span></b>  and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐέλδομαι</span></b> , poet. Verb, only pres. and
		impf., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>wish,
			long</i>, c. inf., <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				13.638
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				4.162
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				1.4
			</span></i>: c. gen., <i>long for</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σὴν ἄλοχον τῆς αἰὲν ἐέλδεαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					5.210
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλδόμεναι πεδίοιο</span> (of
			mules) <i>eager to reach</i> it, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				23.122
			</span></i>: c.acc., <i>desire</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑὸν αὐτοῦ χρεῖος ἐελδόμενος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					1.409
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				5.481
			</span></i>: abs., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νόστησας ἐελδομένοισι μάλ᾽ ἡμῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					24.400
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			 only once, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νῦν τοι ἐελδέσθω
				πόλεμος</span>
			<i>be</i> war now <i>welcome</i> to thee, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				16.494
			</span></i>.</div>
